-- תקנון שירות עובדי הוראה, פרק 6, §6.9 מורה מרכז מעבדה
-- The laboratory coordinator in a post-primary school: when one may be
-- appointed, who qualifies, for how long, and the coordination reward.

IMPORT prelude
IMPORT common

§ `6.9 מורה מרכז מעבדה`

@desc Who acts under section 6.9. The institution's management (הנהלת המוסד) is not one of the takanon's shared parties, so it is declared here.
DECLARE `6.9 party` IS ONE OF
    `the institution's management`
    `the lab coordinator`

@desc An institution and the year's laboratory, as far as section 6.9 asks about them.
DECLARE `laboratory school` HAS
    `is a post-primary institution`             IS A BOOLEAN
    `number of classes`                         IS A NUMBER
    `has a laboratory recognised by the Ministry` IS A BOOLEAN  @desc recognised by the Ministry of Education for this purpose
    `weekly hours the school's classes use the laboratory` IS A NUMBER

@desc The laboratory coordination reward, whose amount section 1.12 sets; an input until 1.12 is encoded.
ASSUME `the lab coordination reward set by section 1.12` IS A NUMBER

@desc A teacher considered for laboratory coordinator.
DECLARE `lab coordinator candidate` HAS
    `position fraction in laboratory subjects` IS A NUMBER @desc the share of a full position the teacher holds in the subjects in which the laboratory hours are given (1 = full)

@desc The approvals an appointment was given.
DECLARE `lab appointment approvals` HAS
    `approved by the supervisor`               IS A BOOLEAN
    `approved by the institution's management` IS A BOOLEAN
    `approved by the owner`                    IS A BOOLEAN @desc the owning body (הבעלות)

§§ `6.9.2 מינוי`

@ref akn:chp_6__sec_6_9__ssec_6_9_2__para_1
GIVEN s IS A `laboratory school`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `the institution may have a lab coordinator` s IF
        s's `is a post-primary institution`
    AND s's `number of classes` AT LEAST 8
    AND s's `has a laboratory recognised by the Ministry`

-- The approvals §6.9.2.1 names, as printed: the supervisor's and the
-- institution management's — the appointing body's own (F-6.9-a).
@ref akn:chp_6__sec_6_9__ssec_6_9_2__para_1
GIVEN a IS A `lab appointment approvals`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `has the approvals §6.9.2.1 names` a IF
    a's `approved by the supervisor` AND a's `approved by the institution's management`

-- §6.9.2.3's approvals: the supervisor's and the owner's.
@ref akn:chp_6__sec_6_9__ssec_6_9_2__para_3
GIVEN a IS A `lab appointment approvals`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `has the approvals §6.9.2.3 names` a IF
    a's `approved by the supervisor` AND a's `approved by the owner`

-- F-6.9-a: the two clauses name different approvals for one appointment.
-- An appointment the supervisor and the owner approved passes §6.9.2.3
-- and fails §6.9.2.1; one approved by the supervisor and the management
-- passes §6.9.2.1 and fails §6.9.2.3.
`supervisor and owner only` MEANS
    `lab appointment approvals` WITH
        `approved by the supervisor`               IS TRUE
        `approved by the institution's management` IS FALSE
        `approved by the owner`                    IS TRUE

`§6.9.2.1 and §6.9.2.3 name different approvals for the appointment` MEANS
    NOT (`has the approvals §6.9.2.1 names` `supervisor and owner only`
         EQUALS `has the approvals §6.9.2.3 names` `supervisor and owner only`)
#ASSERT `§6.9.2.1 and §6.9.2.3 name different approvals for the appointment`

-- The reading adopted (F-6.9-a): the management appoints, so its own
-- approval is no condition; the approvals required are the supervisor's
-- and the owner's, as §6.9.2.3 says.
GIVEN a IS A `lab appointment approvals`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `the appointment is approved` a IF
    `has the approvals §6.9.2.3 names` a

-- "המועסק ב-1/3 משרה" is read as at least a third of a position in the
-- laboratory subjects: §6.10.2ב.4 says "לפחות" in the same rule for
-- subject coordinators, and nothing suggests more is a bar.
@ref akn:chp_6__sec_6_9__ssec_6_9_2__para_2
GIVEN c IS A `lab coordinator candidate`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `may be appointed lab coordinator` c IF
    c's `position fraction in laboratory subjects` AT LEAST 1/3

DECLARE `lab coordinator action` IS ONE OF
    `appoint a lab coordinator` HAS `for school years` IS A NUMBER

-- §6.9.2.1 (permission) and §6.9.2.3 (one school year, made at the start
-- of each year). Time is in school months: the appointment is made by the
-- start of the year (month 1, September) and for one year only.
@ref akn:chp_6__sec_6_9__ssec_6_9_2__para_3
GIVEN s IS A `laboratory school`, c IS A `lab coordinator candidate`, a IS A `lab appointment approvals`
GIVETH A DEONTIC `6.9 party` `lab coordinator action`
DECIDE `appointing a lab coordinator` s c a IS
    IF `the institution may have a lab coordinator` s
       AND `may be appointed lab coordinator` c
       AND `the appointment is approved` a
    THEN PARTY `the institution's management`
         MAY   `appoint a lab coordinator` years
               PROVIDED years EQUALS 1
         WITHIN 1
    ELSE PARTY `the institution's management`
         SHANT `appoint a lab coordinator` years
         LEST BREACH BY `the institution's management` BECAUSE "section 6.9.2: the school, the teacher or the approvals do not meet the conditions"

-- §6.9.2.3: the number of hours the school's classes use the laboratory
-- governs the appointment; the text gives no figure, so it is carried as
-- the input on which the coordination reward of section 1.12 is set.
@ref akn:chp_6__sec_6_9__ssec_6_9_2__para_3
GIVEN s IS A `laboratory school`
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `laboratory hours the appointment follows` s IS
    s's `weekly hours the school's classes use the laboratory`

-- §6.9.2.4: a change in hours that changes the reward or ends the
-- appointment takes effect from the start of the month after the change.
-- Months are school months (September = 1).
@ref akn:chp_6__sec_6_9__ssec_6_9_2__para_4
GIVEN `month of the change` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `month the change takes effect` `month of the change` IS
    `month of the change` PLUS 1

@ref akn:chp_6__sec_6_9__ssec_6_9_2__para_5
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `serving as lab coordinator confers tenure in the role or the reward` IF
    FALSE

-- akn:chp_6__sec_6_9__ssec_6_9_2__para_6 A pointer to section 1.12 (appointments and rewards of post-holders), encoded there.

-- akn:chp_6__sec_6_9__ssec_6_9_2/p1 akn:chp_6__sec_6_9__ssec_6_9_2/p2 akn:chp_6__sec_6_9__ssec_6_9_2/p3 akn:chp_6__sec_6_9__ssec_6_9_2/p4 akn:chp_6__sec_6_9__ssec_6_9_2/p5 The section's sources (אסמכתא): a list of the circulars it rests on.

§§ `6.9.6 גמול ריכוז מעבדה`

@ref akn:chp_6__sec_6_9__ssec_6_9_6/p1 akn:chp_6__sec_6_9__ssec_6_9_6/p2
GIVEN `is an appointed lab coordinator` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `lab coordination reward` `is an appointed lab coordinator` IS
    IF `is an appointed lab coordinator`
    THEN `the lab coordination reward set by section 1.12`
    ELSE 0

-- Examples (placeholder school and teacher).
`a 12-class high school with a recognised lab` MEANS
    `laboratory school` WITH
        `is a post-primary institution`               IS TRUE
        `number of classes`                           IS 12
        `has a laboratory recognised by the Ministry` IS TRUE
        `weekly hours the school's classes use the laboratory` IS 20

`a half-position chemistry teacher` MEANS
    `lab coordinator candidate` WITH `position fraction in laboratory subjects` IS 1/2

`approved by supervisor and owner` MEANS
    `lab appointment approvals` WITH
        `approved by the supervisor`               IS TRUE
        `approved by the institution's management` IS TRUE
        `approved by the owner`                    IS TRUE

#ASSERT `the institution may have a lab coordinator` `a 12-class high school with a recognised lab`
#ASSERT `month the change takes effect` (`month number` November) EQUALS `month number` December

-- Appointed for one year at the start of the year: the permission is used.
#TRACE `appointing a lab coordinator` `a 12-class high school with a recognised lab` `a half-position chemistry teacher` `approved by supervisor and owner` AT 0 WITH
    PARTY `the institution's management` DOES `appoint a lab coordinator` 1 AT 1
